ect it again to continue.'=>'A ti fagilé ìsopọ̀ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí mọ́ Zinn Digital®. Tún un sopọ̀ láti tẹ̀síwájú.','Zinn Digital® no longer recognises this site\'s connection. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò mọ àsopọ̀ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí mọ́. So ó pọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i láti tẹ̀síwájú.','Too many requests were sent from this site or address. Wait a little, then try again.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn ìbéèrè ni a ti rán láti orí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tàbí àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì yìí. Dúró díẹ̀, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Zinn Digital® could not accept this request. Check the email address and the message, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le gba ìbéèrè yìí. Yẹ àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì àti ìfiranṣẹ́ náà wò, lẹ́yìn náà kí o tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn Digital® could not handle the request just now. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le bójútó ìbéèrè náà ní báyìí. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ si.','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Wiwọle atilẹyin igba diẹ yii ti pari.','The licensing service is not available on this site.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àṣẹ kò sí lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','The trial could not be started here. Continue on the trial page instead.'=>'Kò le bẹ̀rẹ̀ àkókò ìdánwò níhìn-ín. Kàkà bẹ́ẹ̀, tẹ̀síwájú lórí ojú-ewé àkókò ìdánwò.','Pages saved as standard WordPress blocks'=>'Àwọn ojú-ewé tí a fi pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn bulọ́ọ̀kì WordPress tó wà ní ìbámu','Sandwich Studio: a full-screen visual editor'=>'Sandwich Studio: olótùú ojú-ìwòye gbogbo-ojú-ìbòjú','Works inside the normal block editor too'=>'Ó tún ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú olóòtú àkópọ̀ déédéé pẹ̀lú','Automatic upgrade of old Page Builder Sandwich pages'=>'Ìgbéga aládàáṣiṣẹ́ ti àwọn ojú-ìwé Page Builder Sandwich àtijọ́','Import from Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder and WPBakery'=>'Kó wọlé láti Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder àti WPBakery','Latest WordPress and PHP, tested every release'=>'WordPress àti PHP tuntun jùlọ, tí a dánwò ní gbogbo ìgbà ìtúsílẹ̀','Security by design'=>'Aabo lati ibẹrẹ igbero','Translated in