 ti a ṣatunṣe fun iyara ati fun awọn aaye lori ọpọlọpọ awọn ede.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Wo alejo gbigba Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Gba amọdaju WordPress kan lori ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́ aládàáni fún àwòrán, ìdàgbàsókè, ìtumọ̀ àti iṣẹ́ SEO ti WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Ṣe abẹwo si ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Alejo aaye pupọ ati PBN','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd jẹ́ pẹpẹ wa fún gbígbàlejò àti ṣíṣàkóso ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Ṣabẹwo si PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Gba Page Builder Sandwich Pro àti Tranzly Pro papọ̀','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Àpapọ̀ náà kéré ní iye owó ju ríra àwọn àfikún méjèèjì lọ́nà ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀, lórí àwọn ètò àti àwọn ààlà ojúlé kan náà.','See the bundle'=>'Wo àkójọpọ̀ náà','Get %s'=>'Gba %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Ìṣepọ̀ ń ṣiṣẹ́: %1$s àti %2$s ń ṣiṣẹ́ papọ̀','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s n ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii, nitori naa awọn afikun mejeeji pin eto kan ti awọn kọkọrọ olupese AI ati oju-iboju eto kan fun wọn.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ṣe afitúmọ̀ ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pẹ̀lú Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Kọ́ àwọn ojú-ewé ní ọ̀nà ìfojúrí pẹ̀lú Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, láti Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade gbogbo oju-iwe ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ede, pẹlu awọn adirẹsi ti a tumọ, data SEO ati oluyipada ede. O n ṣiṣẹ pẹlu awọn oju-iwe ti ẹ kọ nibi.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ṣe apẹrẹ awọn oju-iwe taara ninu olootu pẹlu awọn bulọọki ti o yara ti ko si fi ipasẹ silẹ. Ohun gbogbo ti o ba kọ ni a nṣe itumọ rẹ pẹlu Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s jẹ́ ṣiṣẹ́ nipasẹ ẹgbẹ́ kanna ó sì ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú plugin yìí.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ gba láti so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli to wulo sii.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Gba láti fi ìwífún ìrànwọ́ ránṣẹ́ kọ́kọ́.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Kọ koko-ọrọ ati ifiranṣẹ kan.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Tẹ àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail kan tí àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ le fèsì sí.','AI providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá ChatGPT. Ohun tí ó dára fún onírúurú iṣẹ́.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá Claude. Ó tayọ nínú kíkọ̀wé àti ìrònú pẹ̀lú ìṣọ́ra.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe Gemini ti Google. Ó yára, kò sì gbówó lórí.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ile-iṣẹ AI ti Yuroopu kan pẹlu awọn awoṣe ti o yara ti ko si gbowolori.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ olówó pọ́ọ́kú tí wọ́n dára nídìí kíkọ̀wé àti àmì-ọ̀rọ̀ koodu.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan fún àwọn àwòṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Iṣẹ́ èyíkéyìí tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, pẹ̀lú àwòṣe kan tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọ̀mpútà tàbí ẹ̀rọ-ìpèsè tirẹ̀.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gbogbogbò (a máa ń lò ó nígbà tí kò bá sí ohun pàtó kan tí a tò)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kíkọ àti àtúnkọ','Translation'=>'Ìyípadà èdè','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu àti CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Ẹ má bínú, a kò gbà yín láyè láti wo ojú ewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Gbogbo afikun ti o nlo won lo n pin awon eto yii: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Awọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ jẹ́ fifi pamọ́ sinu àkójọ data ti aaye yii ati pe a máa ń fi wọ́n ranṣẹ si olupese ti o yàn nikan — kò le jẹ́ sọ́dọ̀ wa láé.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Igbéṣẹ̀ 1 ninu 2: yan olùpèsè AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Ẹ máa mú kókóró tiyín wá, nítorí náà ẹ máa sanwó tààràtà fún olùpèsè fún ohun tí ẹ lò. Ṣé kò dá yín lójú? Èyíkéyìí nínú àwọn yìí ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa; ẹ lè fi kún un nígbà mìíràn.','Next'=>'Tókàn','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Igbese 2 ninu 2: so %s pọ','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ àdírẹ́sì iṣẹ́ rẹ tí ó bá OpenAI mu, tí ó parí sí /v1. Kókó kọ́kọ́rọ́ wúlò kìkì bí iṣẹ́ náà bá béèrè fún un.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ́lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ewé àwọn kókórọ́ API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì dà á kọ.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Lẹ mọ́ ìsàlẹ̀ kí o sì tẹ "Fipamọ́ kí o dán wò". A máa ń fi ìbéèrè kékeré kan ránṣẹ́ láti ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Pupọ awọn olupese nilo kirẹditi diẹ lori akọọlẹ ṣaaju ki kọkọrọ kan to ṣiṣẹ: %s.','add credit'=>'Fi kirediti kun','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese ọtọọti','Address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Kókó tí a fipamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ kìí tuntun kan láti fi rọ́pò rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Kókó (ìyànfẹ́)','API key'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ́ kí o sì dán an wò','Providers'=>'Àwọn Olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olùpèsè','Status'=>'Ipò','Key'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́','Get a key'=>'Gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọ kúrò','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Fipamọ́ nipasẹ ẹya afikun ti o jẹ tuntun: ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọ́tìnnì náà sii lẹẹkansi.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣí kókóró tí a fipamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kókóró àbò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ti yípadà). Tún un tẹ̀ sí i.','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti sopọ — idanwo to kẹhin kọja %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo ti o kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ti so pọ̀ — a kò tíì dán an wò','Which model to use'=>'Àwòṣe wo ni láti lò','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ń ṣe àmì àbá wa fún iṣẹ́ náà. Àtòjọ náà pẹ̀lú gbogbo àwòṣe tí kọ́kọ́rọ́ yín lè lò, tí a kà ní tààrà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A gbaniyanju rẹ fun olupese —','Save models'=>'Fi àwọn àwòṣe pamọ́','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkójọ àwòṣe di ọ̀tun láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn olupese','Images'=>'Àwọn àwòrán','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'So OpenAI tàbí Google Gemini pọ̀ láti ṣe àwọn àwòrán.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Àwòṣe àwòrán tuntun jùlọ ti olùpèsè àkọ́kọ́ tí a sopọ̀ —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Ìwárí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù (àwọn ìfikún)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí OpenRouter pọ̀ láti kọ́ atọ́ka àwárí ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Àwòṣe ìfidípọ̀ títun jùlọ ti olùpèsè àkọ́kọ́ tí a so pọ̀ —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Yíyí èyí padà yóò tún atọ́ka àwárí gbogbo àfikún tí ó ń lò ó kọ́.','best quality'=>'didara to dara julọ','lowest cost'=>'iye owo to kere julọ','fastest'=>'Tó yára jùlọ','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwòṣe kún fúnrarẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Àwòṣe kan jáde lónìí? Lẹ orúkọ rẹ̀ gan-an mọ́ ọn láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orukọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi àwòṣe kún','Recommended models list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a dámọ̀ràn','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A kò le ṣe ìfìdálẹjọ àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a dámọ̀ràn, nítorí náà a kò fi àwọn àbá kankan hàn. Tún àtìlẹ́yìn (plugin) náà fi sípò, tàbí kí ẹ tan àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun ojoojúmọ́ ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Akojọ ti a nlo ni a tẹjade ni %s. Imudojuiwọn itanna kọọkan n mu tuntun wa.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Bákan náà, ẹ máa ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lójúmọ́ fún àkójọ tí a sọ di ọ̀tun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìgbàsílẹ̀ lásán nìkan ni a ń fi ránṣẹ́: kò sí kókó kọ́kọ́rọ́, kò sí àdírẹ́sì ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù, kò sí nǹkan kan nípa àkóónú yín. A buwọ́ lu àkójọ náà, a sì ń fojú fo àkójọ èyíkéyìí tí kò bá yege nínú àyẹ̀wò ìbuwọ́lù náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ìyẹ̀wò kẹ́yìn %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fi pamọ́, kí o sì ṣàyẹ̀wò báyìí bí ó bá wà ní títàn','a newer list was installed'=>'a fi àtòjọ tuntun síbẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'ìgbàsílẹ̀ náà kùnà àyẹ̀wò ìfọwọ́sí a sì fojú fo ó','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Kò ṣeéṣe láti kàn sí Zinn Digital®; àtòjọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yóò wà ní lílò nìṣó','turned off'=>'Ti wa ni pipa','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojú-ewé ìsanwó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú-ìwé àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ẹ má bínú, a kò gbà yín láàyè láti ṣe èyí.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olùpèsè tí a kò mọ̀.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì iṣẹ́ rẹ síbí, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Kò jọ kókóŕọ API. Tún ṣe àdàkọ rẹ̀, láìsí àwọn àyè.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Lẹ́ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API rẹ síbẹ̀ ná.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn àwòṣe pamọ́.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ pípé ti àwòṣe náà sí i, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ olùpèsè ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A ti fi %s kún un. Yàn án lábẹ́ "Èwo nínú àwọn àwòṣe láti lò".','Model removed.'=>'A ti yọ àwòṣe náà kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'A ti pa àwọn àmúgbàjẹ́ ojúmọ́. Àtòjọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú àfikún náà ni a ń lò.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti yẹ ẹ wo: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A ti sọ àwọn àtòjọ àwòṣe dọ̀tun.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn ohun itanna rẹ ti fipamọ kọkọrọ AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn ohun itanna yii, tabi tẹ kọkọrọ naa lẹẹkansi ninu awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI tí ẹ fi pamọ́ kò ṣe é ṣí mọ́ (àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ti yípadà). Ẹ tún tẹ̀ ẹ́ síbẹ̀ nínú àwọn ètò AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò AI. Ṣàfikún kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan fún olùpèsè AI nínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí àwòṣe tí a yàn fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Olupese AI yẹn kò ní àtìlẹ́yìn láti ọwọ́ ẹ̀dà àtúnṣe-afikún yìí.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí olùpèsè AI tí ó lè ya àwòrán tí a so pọ̀. Ṣe àfikún kókórọ́ OpenAI tàbí Google Gemini nínú àwọn ètò AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le ṣe awọn aworan. Yan OpenAI tabi Google Gemini fun awọn aworan ninu awọn eto AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI yín kò lè lo àwòṣe àwòrán kankan. Ẹ yẹ àwọn àṣẹ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà wò pẹ̀lú olùpèsè, tàbí kí ẹ yan olùpèsè mìíràn fún àwọn àwòrán.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí olùpèsè AI tí a so pọ̀ tó lè kọ́ atọ́ka àwárí. Ṣàfikún kókórọ́ Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí OpenRouter nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI yín kò lè lo àwòṣe ìfisínú kankan. Ẹ yẹ àwọn àṣẹ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà wò pẹ̀lú olùpèsè, tàbí kí ẹ yan olùpèsè mìíràn fún àwárí orí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Olùpèsè AI yìí kò lè kọ́ atọ́ka àwárí. Sopọ̀ Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí iṣẹ́ tí ó bá a mu fún àwárí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Aaye yii kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ iṣẹ́ AI rẹ. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ àti pé a lè dé àdírẹ́sì rẹ̀ láti orí ẹ̀rọ olupin wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ (a kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ iṣẹ́ kan lórí kọ̀mpútà tirẹ láti aaye tí a gbàlejò).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de ọdọ %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, olupese gbigbalejo rẹ le n ṣe idiwọ awọn asopọ ti njade, tabi adirẹsi naa jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pe akọọlẹ rẹ ko ni kirediti tabi ipin ti o ku mọ. Fi kirediti kun tabi gbe opin rẹ ga ninu akọọlẹ rẹ pẹlu wọn, lẹhinna tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kókó́rọ́ rẹ. Ó lè jẹ́ pé a tẹ̀ ẹ́ lọ́nà tí kò tọ́, a ti fagilé e tàbí ó ti parí. Ṣẹ̀dá kókó́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ̀ ẹ́ sí ibí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ. Kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà le má ní àǹfààní sí àwòṣe tàbí àbùdá yìí, tàbí àkópọ̀ rẹ nílò ìfìdálẹ́jọ́.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Àwòṣe "%1$s" kò sí láti %2$s fún kókórọ́ rẹ. Yan àwòṣe mìíràn nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ kò pẹ̀lú àwòṣe "%1$s". Yan àwòṣe mìíràn nínú àwọn ètò AI, tàbí gbé ètò rẹ ga pẹ̀lú wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s n dín bí kókóró rẹ ṣe lè yára fi àwọn ìbéèrè ránṣẹ́ kù. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú kan kí o sì tún gbìyànjú, tàbí kí o gbé ààlà ìwọ̀n rẹ ga pẹ̀lú wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s ń ní àwọn ìṣòro lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ (ìdáwọ́dúró iṣẹ́ tàbí àkunyá lórí ẹ̀rọ tiwọn). Kò sí ohun tí ó ṣe àwọn ètè rẹ. Tún gbiyanju láìpẹ́.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè dá mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń tẹ̀síwájú, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olùpèsè AI dáhùn ní ọ̀nà tí àfikún yìí kò lè kà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; bí ó bá ń tẹ̀síwájú, yan àwòṣe mìíràn tàbí kí o kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Aṣaṣe (ti o baamu OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ ń ṣiṣẹ́, ṣùgbọ́n olùpèsè náà kò ṣe àkójọ àpẹẹrẹ ọ̀rọ̀ kankan fún un. Ṣe àfikún àpẹẹrẹ fúnra rẹ ní ìsàlẹ̀.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ̀. %1$s dáhùn nípa lílo %2$s. Àwọn ẹ̀yà AI yín ti ṣetán láti lò.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ipa olùmúlò rẹ kò lẹ́tọ̀ọ́ láti lo AI lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alábòójútó.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí ti dé òpin ìnáwó AI ti oṣooṣù rẹ̀. Olùmójútó kan lè gbée ga nínú àwọn ètò AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Aaye yii ti de opin oṣooṣu ti awọn ibeere AI rẹ. Alakoso le gbe e ga ninu awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Ìlò àti iye owó','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ ipò wúlò fún AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Awọn iye owo jẹ ifoju, ti a ṣe iṣiro lati awọn idiyele ti a tẹjade; awoṣe ti ko ni idiyele ti a mọ ni a ka si odo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: àwọn ìbéèrè %1$s, nǹkan bí %2$s.','When'=>'Nigbawo','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'A lò fún','Model'=>'Àwòṣe','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn àmì tó wọlé / jáde','About'=>'Nípa','Result'=>'Èsì','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'A kò tíì ṣe àwọn ìbéèrè AI kankan títí di báyìí.','Done'=>'Ti parí','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn ìyọ̀nda','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ìwọ̀n ìnáwó oṣooṣù (dọ́là US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofo fun ko si aala. AI n duro fun iyoku oṣu naa ni kete ti idiyele ifoju ba de ọdọ rẹ.','Monthly request limit'=>'Òpin àbá oṣooṣù','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofifo fun ko si idiwọn.','Who may use AI'=>'Àwọn tí ó lè lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Má ṣe yan èkankan kí gbogbo àwọn tí wọ́n lè lo àwọn àbùdá afikun náà lè lo AI. Àwọn alámùójútó lè lò ó ní gbogbo ìgbà.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fi àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ pamọ́','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ pamọ́.','The post or page ID.'=>'ID àtẹjade tàbí ojú-ewé náà.','Write or rewrite text with AI'=>'Kọ tabi tunkọ ọrọ pẹlu AI','Writes new text, or improves, shortens, expands, changes the tone of or fixes the grammar of a piece of text, with the site\'s own AI provider. Returns the new text; nothing on the site is changed.'=>'Kọ ọ̀rọ̀ tuntun, tàbí mú sunwọ̀n síi, kékúrú, gbòòrò, yí ohùn padà tàbí tún gírámà apá kan ọ̀rọ̀ ṣe, pẹ̀lú olùpèsè AI ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà gan-an. Ó ń dá ọ̀rọ̀ tuntun náà padà; kò sí ohun kankan tí a yípadà lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Generate a section with AI'=>'Ṣẹda abala kan pẹlu AI','Turns a one-sentence description into a ready-designed section (real, editable blocks in the site\'s brand style) with text written for it. Returns the block markup, and adds it to the start or end of a page when a post_id is given (a revision keeps what was there before).'=>'Ó ń sọ àpèjúwe gbólóhùn kan di abala tí a ti ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ rẹ̀ tán (àwọn búlọ́ọ̀kì gidi tí a lè ṣàtúnṣe nínú àṣà àmì-ìdámọ̀ ojú-òpó náà) pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ tí a kọ fún un. Ó ń dá àkọsílẹ̀ búlọ́ọ̀kì padà, ó sì ń fi kún ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ tàbí òpin ojú-ewé kan nígbà tí a bá pèsè post_id (àtúnyẹ̀wò kan ń pa ohun tí ó wà níbẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀ mọ́).','Suggest an SEO title and description with AI'=>'Daba akọle SEO ati apejuwe pẹlu AI','Reads a page and suggests a meta title (up to 60 characters) and meta description (up to 155), optionally around a focus keyword. Nothing is saved.'=>'Ó máa ń ka ojú-ewé kan tí yóò sì dábàá àkọlé meta (títí dé àwọn lẹ́tà 60) àti àpèjúwe meta (títí dé 155), pẹ̀lú àṣàyàn ní àyíká ọ̀rọ̀ kókó pàtàkì kan. Kò sí ohun tí a fipamọ́.','Save an SEO title and description'=>'Fi akọle ati apejuwe SEO pamọ','Saves a meta title and description into the SEO plugin the site uses (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO) and says which ones were written.'=>'Ó fi àkọlé àti àpèjúwe meta pamọ́ sínú àtìlẹ́yìn SEO tí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà ń lò (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress tàbí All in One SEO) ó sì sọ èyí tí a kọ.','Write image alt text with AI'=>'Kọ ọ̀rọ̀ àtúnṣe àwòrán pẹ̀lú AI','Looks at images and saves alt text for them: one image (attachment_id), or every image on a page that has none (post_id). At most 20 images per call; the answer says how many remain.'=>'Ó ń wo àwọn àwòrán ó sì ń fi àkọsílẹ̀ alt pamọ́ fún wọn: àwòrán kan (attachment_id), tàbí gbogbo àwòrán lórí ojú-ewé tí kò ní kankan (post_id). Ó pọ̀ jù àwòrán 20 fún ìpè kọ̀ọ̀kan; ìdáhùn náà yóò sọ iye tí ó kù.','Undo an AI change'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àyípadà AI','Puts a page back the way it was before an AI change, from the undo_revision that change returned.'=>'O n da oju-iwe pada si bi o ti wa ṣaaju iyipada AI, lati inu undo_revision ti iyipada naa da pada.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'AI kò sí nínú àkójọpọ̀ yìí.','The AI answered in a form the builder cannot read. Try again, or choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'AI dáhùn ní ọ̀nà tí olùkọ́ kò lè kà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi, tàbí yan àwòṣe mìíràn nínú àwọn ètò AI.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The AI rewrote %1$d of %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'AI ti tun %1$d ninu awọn ọrọ %2$d kọ, nitori naa ko si ohun ti a yipada. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','The AI used blocks this site does not have (%s), so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'AI lo awọn bulọọku ti aaye yii ko ni (%s), nitorinaa ko si ohun ti a yipada. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','The AI answer contained markup your account may not save, so nothing was changed.'=>'Idahun AI ni ami si eyiti akanti yin le ma le fipamo, nitorina ko si ohun ti a yi pada.','There is no such post, or you may not edit it.'=>'Kò sí irú àtẹ̀jáde bẹ́ẹ̀, tàbí ẹ lè má lẹ́tọ̀ọ́ láti ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀.','That change can no longer be undone: its saved copy is gone.'=>'A ko le yi iyipada yẹn pada mọ: ẹda rẹ ti a fipamọ ti sọnu.','The change could not be undone. Restore it from the post\'s revisions instead.'=>'A ko le yi iyipada naa pada. Mu pada lati inu awọn atunyẹwo ifiweranṣẹ dipo.','The page has too little text to write a description from. Add content first.'=>'Oju-iwe naa ni ọrọ ti o kere ju lati kọ apejuwe lati inu rẹ. Kọkọ fi akoonu kun.','No supported SEO plugin is active (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO), so there is nowhere to save the meta title and description.'=>'Kò sí àtìlẹ́yìn ohun àfikún SEO kankan tó wà ní ṣíṣe (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress tàbí All in One SEO), nítorí náà kò sí ibì kankan láti fi àkọlé àti àpèjúwe meta pamọ́ sí.','That is not an image you may edit.'=>'Ìyẹn kì í ṣe àwòrán tí ẹ lè ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀.','Only PNG, JPEG, GIF and WebP images can be described.'=>'Àwọn àwòrán PNG, JPEG, GIF àti WebP nìkan ni a lè ṣàpèjúwe.','The image is too large to send to the AI (4 MB at most).'=>'Àwòrán náà tóbi jù láti fi ránṣẹ́ sí AI (ó pọ̀ jù 4 MB).','Unknown AI writing action.'=>'Iṣe kikọ AI ti a ko mọ.','There is no text to rewrite. Type some first, or ask AI to write it.'=>'Kò sí ọ̀rọ̀ kankan láti tún kọ. Kọ díẹ̀ kọ́kọ́, tàbí kí o béèrè lọ́wọ́ AI láti kọ ọ́.','Say what the text should be about.'=>'Sọ ohun tí àkọsílẹ̀ náà gbọ́dọ̀ dá lé lórí.','Choose one of the offered tones.'=>'Yan ọkan ninu awọn ohun orin ti a nṣe.','That is too much text for one AI request. Select a shorter part.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ náà pọ̀ jù fún ìbéèrè AI kan ṣoṣo. Yan apá kan tí ó kúrú sí i.','The AI returned no text. Try again.'=>'AI kò da ọ̀rọ̀ kankan padà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Describe the section in a sentence (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Ṣàpèjúwe apá náà nínú gbólóhùn kan (títí dé 2,000 àwọn lẹ́tà).','There are no sections in the library to build from.'=>'Kò sí àwọn abala nínú àkójọ láti kọ́ láti inú rẹ̀.','There is no section called "%s".'=>'Kò sí abala tí a pè ní "%s".','The AI did not choose a section from the library. Pick one yourself, or describe it differently.'=>'AI kò yan apá kan láti inú àkójọ. Yan ọ̀kan fúnra rẹ, tàbí kí o ṣàlàyé rẹ̀ lọ́nà míràn.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Àṣìṣe ààbò, jọ̀wọ́ sọ ojú-ewé náà dọ̀tun kí o sì tún gbìyànjú.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn ti sọnù. Ẹ jọ̀wọ́ kan sí alákòóso.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn kò tọ́. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí alámòójútó.','Invalid email address.'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli ti ko tọ.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ àpótí náà láti gbà kí o tó forúkọ sílẹ̀.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ìgbìyànjú ti pọ̀ jù. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i láàárín ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Nǹkan kan ti lọ sọ́nà tí kò tọ́. Ẹ jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí olùmójútó.','Map'=>'Mẹ́ẹ̀pù','Background video'=>'Fídíò àlùmọ́ọ́lẹ́','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ntì %2$d ti wà ní ìpamọ́, ewé àkàwé àṣà %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'A kò tọ́jú ẹbí yẹn.','Removed.'=>'A ti yọ ọ kuro.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Yẹn kì í ṣe orúkọ ẹbí fonti tó tọ́.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts kò dá ìdílé yẹn padà. Ṣàyèwò orúkọ náà kí o sì tún gbìyànjú.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Kò lè ṣe é ṣe láti gba àwọn fáìlì fọ́ọ̀ǹtì wọlé tàbí kí a fipamọ́ wọn. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá folda ìrùsókè ní ẹ̀tọ́ fún kíkọ síi.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Kò lè fi iwe ara-lẹta pamọ́. Ṣe ayẹwo rẹ bóyá a lè kọ nǹkan sí àpò-ìfipamọ́ fún ìrùsókè.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Fojufò àkíyèsí yìí','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yoo ṣí sí taabu tuntun)','Done:'=>'Ti parí:','To do:'=>'Lati ṣe:','Glossary index'=>'Atọ́ka ìwé-ìtumọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'A ṣe ìgbéléwọ̀n rẹ̀ sí %1$s nínú %2$s','Progress'=>'Ìtẹ̀síwájú','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ kóòdù','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Widget yẹn kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','Email'=>'I-meeli','Phone'=>'Fóònù','RSS feed'=>'Ìkóṣẹ́ RSS','Website'=>'Oju-iwe ayelujara','Link'=>'Ìsopọ̀','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (ṣí sí taabu tuntun)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'A ṣe ìwọ̀n rẹ̀ ní %d nínú 5','(recommended)'=>'(a gbani niyanju)','Included'=>'Pẹ̀lú rẹ̀','Not included'=>'Kò sí nínú rẹ̀','Comparison table'=>'Àtẹ ìfiwéra','Call %s'=>'Pe %s','Email %s'=>'I-meeli %s','Text %s'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Sọ̀rọ̀ lórí WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Kan si wa','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Bá wa sọ̀rọ̀ lórí WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Fọọmu yii ko si ni akoko yii.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'A kò le fi fọọmu yìí hàn nítorí pé %s kò ṣiṣẹ́.','Map: %s'=>'Màpá: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Fífihàn maapu naa ń gbe e wọlé láti OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Fi maapu hàn','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Ṣí mààpù náà lórí OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kàlẹ́ńdà ìfipamọ́ láti %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Ṣíṣàfihàn kàlẹ́ńdà ìfipamọ́ máa ń gbe wọlé láti %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Ṣe afihan kalẹnda fowo si','Book on %s'=>'Ṣe ìfipamọ́ lórí %s','QR code for %s'=>'Koodu QR fún %s','Design'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ àwòrán','Content'=>'Àkóónú','Media'=>'Mídíà','Marketing'=>'Titaja','Site'=>'Ojú-òpó','Data'=>'Dátà','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Alafaramo & iGaming','Related posts'=>'Àwọn àtẹ̀jáde tó jọ mọ́ ọ','Post details'=>'Àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ àtẹ̀jáde','By'=>'Látọwọ́','Published'=>'Ti a tẹjade','Updated'=>'Ti ṣe imudojuiwọn','In'=>'Ninu','Tagged'=>'Tí a fi àmì sí','%d minute read'=>'Kíkà fún ìṣẹ́jú %d','No comments yet'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn àwíyé','%d comment'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ %d','Sitemap'=>'Mẹ́ẹ̀pù ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','All posts by %s'=>'Gbogbo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ %s','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Akoonu yii ni aabo. Tẹ ọrọ igbaniwọle sii lati wo o.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé yẹn kò tọ̀nà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Password'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà','Show the content'=>'Fi àkóónú hàn','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'A kò le ṣí ojú-ewé yẹn sílẹ̀.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ìgbìyànjú ti pọ̀ jù. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀-ìwọlé gbọdọ̀ jẹ́ gígùn láti 4 sí 200 lẹ́tà.','More'=>'Púpọ̀ sí i','Close'=>'Tì','Tab %d'=>'Taabu %d','Contents'=>'Àwọn àkóónú','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Àwọn ìwé-àkọsílẹ̀ ojú-iboju alámòójútó kù nínú àdákọ àfikún yìí. Tún fi síi láti inú àkójọ tí a ti sọ di mímọ̀.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ojú-ìwòran yìí nílò JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Àwọn èdè','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Oníbàárà olùgbàlejò wẹ́ẹ̀bù? Gba ẹ̀dinwo %1$d%% lórí %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Gẹ́gẹ́ bí oníbàárà ìgbàlejò lórí Zinn Digital®, o gba kóòdù àdáni fún ẹ̀dinwó %d%% lórí ìsanwó àkọ́kọ́ rẹ. Àwọn ìmúdàtuntun wà ní iye owó déédé.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Gba kóòdù %d%% mi kí o sì lọ sí ìsanwó','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Ẹdinwo yii wa fun awọn onibara ti o ni eto alejo gbigba wẹẹbu ti o sanwo ti o wa ni ipo to dara. Awọn idanwo ọfẹ ko yẹ.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Ẹ ti lo ẹ̀dinwo oníbàárà ìgbàlejò yín tẹ́lẹ̀ fún àfikún yìí.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'A ko le gba koodu yin lowolowo bayi. E jowo e gbiyanju leekansi ni iseju die si i.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́wájú náà gbọdọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà 1 sí 8, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, kò sì gbọdọ̀ dárúkọ àfikún náà.','The kit could not be read. Try again later.'=>'A kò lè ka àkójọ náà. Ẹ tún gbìyànjú lẹ́yìn náà.','This kit comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ yìí wá pẹ̀lú Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','The kit library could not be reached. Check this site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'A kò lè wọlé sí ibi ìkójọpọ̀ kit náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè ṣe àwọn ìsopọ̀ tó ń jáde, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The kit library refused th