ete some to save more.'=>'Àkójọ àwọsánmọ̀ rẹ ní iye àwọn àpẹẹrẹ bí ètò rẹ ṣe gbà láàyè. Pa díẹ̀ rẹ́ láti fi púpọ̀ sí i pamọ́.','This design is too large to save to the cloud library (2 MB at most).'=>'Àwòrán yìí tóbi jù láti fi pamọ́ sí àkójọ ìwé orí kọ̀mpútà àwọsánmọ̀ (MB 2 ní púpọ̀ jùlọ).','An image in this design is too large for the cloud library.'=>'Àwòrán kan nínú àwòrán yìí tóbi jù fún àkójọ awọsánmọ̀.','An image in this design could not be saved. The cloud library keeps WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF and AVIF images.'=>'A ko le fi aworan kan pamọ ninu apẹrẹ yii. Ile-ikawe awọsanma n tọju awọn aworan WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF ati AVIF.','Your licence has expired or was cancelled, so nothing new can be saved. Your saved designs are still here; renew to save again.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ rẹ ti pari tabi a ti fagilee rẹ, nitorinaa ko si ohun tuntun ti a le fipamọ. Awọn aṣa ti o ti fipamọ ṣi wa nibi; sọ di ọtun lati tun fipamọ.','We could not confirm a Page Builder Sandwich Pro licence on this site. Check that the licence is activated here (Account screen).'=>'A kò le ṣe ìmúdájú ìwé-àṣẹ Page Builder Sandwich Pro lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá a ti mú ìwé-àṣẹ náà ṣiṣẹ́ níhìn-ín (Ojú-ìwé Àkọọ́lẹ̀).','This needs Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Eyi nilo Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','This site can use the team library but not change it. Ask the team owner for write access.'=>'Aaye yii le lo ibi ikawe ẹgbẹ naa ṣugbọn ko le yi pada. Beere lọwọ oluwa ẹgbẹ naa fun iraye si kikọ.','Team libraries come with the Agency plan.'=>'Àwọn àkójọ ìwé ẹgbẹ́ wà pẹ̀lú ètò Agency.','Only the licence owner\'s sites can manage teams.'=>'Àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ti ẹni tí ó ni ìwé-àṣẹ nìkan ló lè ṣàkóso àwọn ẹgbẹ́.','That invite code is not valid or has already been used.'=>'Kóòdù ìpè yẹn kò tọ́ tàbí a ti lò ó tẹ́lẹ̀.','You have reached a team limit of your plan.'=>'Ẹ ti dé ààlà ẹgbẹ́ tí ó wà fún ètò yín.','That library item was not found. It may have been deleted on another site.'=>'A kò rí nǹkan àkójọ-ìwé yẹn. Ó ṣeé 