Ìyọwó kíákíá','Choose the brand fonts from the site\'s fonts.'=>'Yan àwọn fọ́ọ̀ntì àmì-ìdánimọ̀ láti inú àwọn fọ́ọ̀ntì ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','That font is no longer in the font library.'=>'Fọ́ọ̀ǹtì yẹn kò sí nínú àkójọ fọ́ọ̀ǹtì mọ́.','That font has no files yet. Upload at least one.'=>'Fọ́ọ̀ǹtì yẹn kò tíì ní fáìlì kankan. Gbà sílẹ̀ ó kéré tán ẹyọ kan.','An Adobe Fonts kit id is 5 to 12 letters and digits, as shown in your Adobe Fonts web project.'=>'Kit id Adobe Fonts kan ní lẹ́tà àti nọ́mbà 5 sí 12, bí a ti fi hàn nínú web project Adobe Fonts yín.','Adobe Fonts did not return that kit. Check the id, and that the web project is published.'=>'Adobe Fonts kò dá kiti yẹn padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò id náà, àti pé a ti tẹ iṣẹ́ àkànṣe wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà jáde.','That Adobe Fonts kit has no fonts in it.'=>'Àkójọ Adobe Fonts yẹn kò ní àwọn fọ́ọ̀ǹtì kankan nínú.','Choose how the site picks its colour scheme.'=>'Yan bí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà yóò ṣe yan ètò àwọ̀ rẹ̀.','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Iye dudu fún "%s" kì í ṣe àwọ̀ CSS tó tọ́.','This site has reached the maximum number of global classes.'=>'Aaye yii ti de iye ti o pọ julọ ti awọn kilasi agbaye.','Give the class a name.'=>'Fún kíláàsì náà ní orúkọ kan.','A class name must start with a letter and use only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Orukọ kilasi gbọdọ bẹrẹ pẹlu lẹta kan ki o si lo awọn lẹta kekere, awọn nọmba ati awọn aami-idapọ nikan.','Another class already uses that name.'=>'Kíláàsì mìíràn ti ń lo orúkọ yẹn tẹ́lẹ̀.','That class no longer exists. Reload the list.'=>'Kíláàsì yẹn kò sí mọ́. Tún àkójọ náà gbé wọlé.','Extra small'=>'Kíkéré gan-an','Small'=>'Kékeré','Medium'=>'Alábọ́dé','Large'=>'Nla','Extra large'=>'Gígadabi ti o tobi pupọ','Huge'=>'Gbilẹ gidi','None'=>'Kò sí','Round'=>'Yika','Each entry needs a unique short name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan nílò orúkọ kúkúrú ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ tí a fi àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, àwọn nọ́mbà àti àwọn àmì ìdásí ṣe.','The value of "%s" is not a value this setting accepts.'=>'Iye "%s" kò sí lára àwọn iye tí ètò yìí ń gbà.','Custom field (post meta)'=>'Pápá àkànṣe (mẹ́tà àkọsílẹ̀)','Filter the list'=>'Ṣẹ́ àkójọ náà','Apply'=>'Muuṣẹ','Newest'=>'Tuntun julọ','Oldest'=>'Tó pẹ́ jù','Title A to Z'=>'Àkọlé A sí Z','Title Z to A'=>'Àkọlé Z sí A','Sort by'=>'Tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ nípa','Price'=>'Iye owó','From'=>'Lati','To'=>'Sí','On sale only'=>'Lori ẹdinwo nikan','In stock only'=>'Àwọn tó wà ní àkójọ nìkan','Any'=>'Eyikeyi','Nothing found.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a rí.','Previous'=>'Ti tẹ́lẹ̀','Pages'=>'Àwọn Ojú-ewé','dynamic content source: a blog post or page (noun)Post'=>'Fiṣẹ́ ránṣẹ́','Archive'=>'Fi pa mọ́ sínú àkójọ','Custom field'=>'Pápá àkànṣe','Excerpt'=>'Àyọkà','Last updated'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tó kẹ́yìn','Featured image'=>'Àwòrán pàtàkì','Featured image alt text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àfidípò àwòrán àfihàn','Number of comments'=>'Iye àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìwòye','Post type'=>'Irú àtẹ̀jáde','Biography'=>'Ìtàn ìgbésí ayé','Profile picture'=>'Àwòrán ojú-ewé','Author archive link'=>'Ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ àkójọpọ̀ ti òǹkọ̀wé','Site title'=>'Àkọlé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Tagline'=>'Àkọlé ọ̀rọ̀','Home page link'=>'Ìsopọ̀ ojú-ewé àkọ́kọ́','Current year'=>'Ọdún lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Archive or category'=>'Àkójọ tàbí ẹ̀ka','Description'=>'Àpèjúwe','Number of posts'=>'Iye àwọn àkọsílẹ̀','Click Here'=>'Tẹ Nibi','The icon is not in the icon sets; pick one in the block.'=>'Aami naa ko si ninu awọn akojọpọ aami; yan ọkan ninu bulọọki naa.','The testimonial slider\'s testimonials were placed one after another.'=>'Awọn ijẹrisi ti esun ijẹrisi naa ni a gbe lẹsẹsẹ.','The slideshow became an image gallery (the images, without the sliding).'=>'Àfihàn àwòrán náà ti di ibi àkójọ àwòrán (àwọn àwòrán náà, láìsí yíyọ̀).','Share buttons were not converted; add the Share buttons block.'=>'A kò yí àwọn bọ́tìnì pínpín padà; ẹ fi bulọ́ọ̀kì bọ́tìnì pínpín kún un.','Not converted: the "%s" module has no equivalent (it shows live data, a form or a widget); add the matching Page Builder Sandwich block in its place.'=>'A kò yí padà: ẹ̀yà "%s" kò ní irú rẹ̀ (ó ń fi dátà àkókò gidi, fọ́ọ̀mù tàbí wíjẹ́ẹ̀tì hàn); fi búlọ́ọ̀kù Page Builder Sandwich tí ó bá a mu sí ipò rẹ̀.','Kept its text, images and link; its own layout and styling were not converted.'=>'Ó pa ọ̀rọ̀, àwọn àwòrán àti ọ̀nà-ìsopọ̀ rẹ̀ mọ́; ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ àti àrà ti ara rẹ̀ kò yí padà.','A background overlay was not converted; check the text is still readable.'=>'A ko ṣe iyipada ideri abẹlẹ; ṣayẹwo boya ọrọ naa ṣi ṣe e ka.','A gradient background became its first colour.'=>'Abẹlẹ gradient di àwọ̀ rẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́.','%1$d shown, %2$d found.'=>'A fihan %1$d, a ri %2$d.','%d page could not be converted.'=>'Kò le yí ojú-ewé %d padà.','The file cannot be read, or is larger than 8 MB.'=>'A ko le ka faili naa, tabi o tobi ju 8 MB lọ.','Connected to Figma as %1$s (token ending %2$s).'=>'Ti sopọ mọ Figma bi %1$s (àtọka ti o pari pẹlu %2$s).','The Figma token was removed.'=>'Aami Figma ti yọkuro.','Not connected to Figma.'=>'A ko sopọ mọ Figma.','The slider\'s slides were placed one after another (the content, without the sliding).'=>'A gbé àwọn àgbéyọ ayọlẹ́nu kalẹ̀ lẹ́yìn ara wọn (àkóónú náà, láìsí yíyọ̀).','Not converted: "%s" shows live site data or a form; add the matching Page Builder Sandwich block (Form, Posts, Map, Countdown…) in its place.'=>'A ko yipada: "%s" n ṣe afihan data aaye laaye tabi fọọmu kan; fi bulọọki Page Builder Sandwich ti o baamu (Form, Posts, Map, Countdown…) si aaye rẹ.','Not converted: the "%s" module has no equivalent; add the matching block by hand.'=>'A kò yí padà: ẹ̀yà "%s" kò ní ìbáramu; fi bulọ́ọ̀kì tí ó bá a mu kún-un pẹ̀lú ọwọ́.','A Divi icon font glyph has no SVG equivalent; pick an icon in the block.'=>'Ami-ọrọ fonti aami Divi ko ni deede SVG; yan aami kan ninu bulọọku naa.','The carousel became an image gallery (the images, without the sliding).'=>'Kárúsẹ́ẹ̀lì náà ti di àtẹ àwòrán (àwọn àwòrán, láìsí yíyọ̀).','Not converted: the "%s" widget has no equivalent and no text or images to keep.'=>'A ko yipada: wíjíìtì "%s" ko ni deede ati pe ko si ọrọ tabi awọn aworan lati tọju.','An uploaded SVG icon was placed as an image.'=>'Aami SVG tí a gbé soke ni a fi síbẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwòrán.','The icon "%s" is not in the icon sets; pick one in the block.'=>'Àmì "%s" kò sí nínú àwọn àkójọ àmì; yan ọ̀kan nínú bulọ́ọ̀kì náà.','That does not look like a Figma personal access token. Create one in Figma: Settings, Security, Personal access tokens.'=>'Ìyẹn kò jọ àmì ìwọlé ti ara ẹni ti Figma. Ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan nínú Figma: Settings, Security, Personal access tokens.','Paste a link to a Figma frame (in Figma: right-click the frame, Copy/Paste as, Copy link to selection).'=>'Lẹ ọna asopọ si freemu Figma kan (ninu Figma: tẹ-ọtun lori freemu naa, Copy/Paste as, Copy link to selection).','That link is to the whole file. Select one frame in Figma and use Copy link to selection, so the link names the frame.'=>'Ọna asopọ yẹn jẹ fun gbogbo faili naa. Yan fireemu kan ninu Figma ki o lo «Copy link to selection», ki ọna asopọ naa le sọ orukọ fireemu naa.','Connect your Figma account first: add a Figma personal access token in Page Builder Sandwich, Import.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ so àkọọ́lẹ̀ Figma rẹ pọ̀: fi àmì ìwọlé àdáni Figma kún un nínú Page Builder Sandwich, Ìgbéwọlé.','Figma has no frame with that link in the file (it may have been deleted).'=>'Figma ko ni fireemu pẹlu ọna asopọ yẹn ninu faili naa (o le ti parẹ).','That link is to a whole Figma page. Select one frame and copy the link to it.'=>'Ọna asopọ yẹn jẹ si gbogbo oju-iwe Figma kan. Yan freemu kan ki o daakọ ọna asopọ si i.','%d drawing was left out: an import renders at most 200.'=>'A fi iyaworan %d sílẹ̀: agbewọle njade julọ 200.','Could not reach Figma. Check the site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ Figma. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé náà lè ṣe àwọn ìsopọ̀ tó ń jáde, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbìyànjú.','Figma refused the token, or the token cannot open this file. Check the token has the "File content: read" scope and that your Figma account can view the file.'=>'Figma kọ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ náà, tàbí àmì-ìdánimọ̀ náà kò lè ṣí fáìlì yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé àmì-ìdánimọ̀ náà ní ààbò "File content: read" àti pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ Figma yín lè wo fáìlì náà.','Figma could not find that file. Check the link, and that your Figma account can view the file.'=>'Figma kò le rí fáìlì yẹn. Yẹ ìjápọ̀ wò, kí o sì rí i dájú pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ Figma rẹ lè wo fáìlì náà.','Figma is limiting requests from your account right now. Wait a minute and try again.'=>'Figma n dinku awon ibeere lati inu akoto re lowolowo. Duro fun iseju kan ki o tun gbiyanju sii.','Figma answered with an error (%d). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Figma fèsì pẹ̀lú àṣìṣe kan (%d). Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','A drawing could not be exported from Figma, so it was left out.'=>'A kò le gbé àwòrán jáde láti Figma, nítorí náà a fi sílẹ̀.','Not converted: Figma "%s" layers have no equivalent.'=>'A kò yí padà: àwọn ipele Figma "%s" kò ní ìbáramu.','Layers placed freely (overlapping) in Figma were stacked; layers that sat on top of each other are now one after another.'=>'Àwọn pẹpẹ tí a gbé sílẹ̀ ní fàlàlà (tí wọ́n dórí ara wọn) nínú Figma ti di kíkó jọ; àwọn pẹpẹ tí wọ́n wà lórí ara wọn tẹ́lẹ̀ ti wà ní tẹ̀léra báyìí.','That page does not exist.'=>'Oju-iwe yẹn ko si.','This page was not built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery, so there is nothing to convert.'=>'A kò fi Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder tàbí WPBakery kọ ojú-ewé yìí, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè yípadà.','Choose Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery.'=>'Yan Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder tabi WPBakery.','Nothing could be read from that export. Check it is the whole file, from the builder you chose.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a lè kà láti inú ìgbéwọle yẹn. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá gbogbo fáìlì náà nìyẹn, láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùkọ́lé tí o yàn.','Imported page'=>'Ojú-ewé tí a kó wọlé','An image could not be copied into the media library, so it still loads from the original site.'=>'A ko le da aworan kan kọ sinu àkójọ faili, nitori naa o ṣi n gbe wọle lati ori aaye ayelujara akọkọ.','More images than one import copies; the rest still load from the original site.'=>'Awọn aworan pọ ju eyiti akowọle kan n da kọ lọ; awọn to ku si n gbe wọle lati aaye atilẹba naa.','Kept as a shortcode: %s shows only while the plugin that provides it is active.'=>'A tọ́jú rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí koodu kukuru: %s máa ń hàn nìkan nígbà tí àfikún tí ó pèsè rẹ̀ bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́.','A parallax or video background became a still background.'=>'Abẹlẹ parallax tabi fidio kan ti di abẹlẹ ti ko gbera.','A column offset became a start margin.'=>'Ìyapa ọwọ̀n di àlà ìbẹ̀rẹ̀.','Image #%d is not in this site\'s media library; add it again.'=>'Àwòrán #%d kò sí nínú àkójọ faili amóhùnmáwòrán ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí; tún fi kún un.','Text on the button'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ lórí bọ́tìnì','The separator\'s title became a heading above the line.'=>'Àkọlé olùpínyà náà di àkọlé lókè ìlà náà.','The pie chart became a number with its label.'=>'Aworan akara oyinbo naa di nọmba kan pẹlu aami rẹ.','Raw JavaScript was not imported (scripts are not copied into page content); add it again with a code snippet tool if you still need it.'=>'A kò kó JavaScript aise wọle (a kì í ṣe àwòkọ àwọn ìwé-àkọsílẹ sínú àkóónú ojú-ewé); tún fi kún un pẹ̀lú irinṣẹ́ àgé-kóòdù bí o bá ṣì nílò rẹ̀.','Not converted: the "%s" element has no equivalent (it shows live data, a form or a widget); add the matching Page Builder Sandwich block in its place.'=>'A ko yi pada: eroja "%s" ko ni deede (o n fi data laaye, fọọmu tabi ohun elo widget han); fi bulọọku Page Builder Sandwich ti o baamu si ipo rẹ.','A/B tests'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò A/B','No test has had visitors yet. Add an A/B test block to a page, publish it, and results appear here.'=>'Kò sí àyẹ̀wò kankan tó tíì ní àwọn àbẹ̀wò. Fi bulọ́ọ̀kì àyẹ̀wò A/B kún ojú-ewé kan, tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde, àwọn èsì yóò sì hàn níhìn-ín.','Page'=>'Oju-iwe','Variant'=>'Ẹ̀yà','Visitors'=>'Àwọn àlejò','Conversions'=>'Àwọn ìyípadà','Rate'=>'Ṣe ìwọ̀n','%1$s wins (%2$s confidence)'=>'%1$s bori (%2$s igbẹkẹle)','No clear winner yet'=>'Kò tíì sí olubori tí ó daju','Unknown service.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àìmọ̀.','That key or API URL does not look right for %s. Copy both from the service\'s API settings.'=>'Kókó-ìṣí tabi API URL yẹn kò dàbí èyí tó tọ́ fún %s. Ṣe àdàkọ àwọn méjèèjì láti ibi àwọn ètò API ti iṣẹ́ náà.','That key does not look right for %s. Copy it again from the service\'s API settings.'=>'Kò dà bíi pé kókórọ́ yẹn tọ̀nà fún %s. Tún ṣe àwòkọ rẹ̀ láti àwọn ètò API ti iṣẹ́ náà.','%s could not be reached from this site. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'A kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ %s láti orí aaye yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá atọ́jú-aaye rẹ gba àwọn ìsopọ̀ tó ń jáde láàyè, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','%s did not accept the key. Check that it is active and has access to your lists.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà. Yẹ ẹ́ wò bóyá ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ tí ó sì ní àyè sí àwọn àkójọ rẹ.','We use cookies to understand how our site is used and to improve it. You choose what we may use.'=>'A ń lo àwọn kúkì láti mọ bí a ṣe ń lo ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù wa àti láti mú un sunwọ̀n sí i. Ẹ̀yin ni ẹ máa yan ohun tí a lè lò.','Privacy policy'=>'Ilana asiri','Analytics'=>'Àtúnyẹ̀wò','Accept all'=>'Gba gbogbo rẹ̀','Save my choice'=>'Fi àṣàyàn mi pamọ́','Necessary only'=>'Àwọn tó pọn dandan nìkan','Cookie banner'=>'Asia kukisi','Form'=>'Fọọmu','New submission: %1$s (%2$s)'=>'Ìfisílẹ̀ tuntun: %1$s (%2$s)','Sent from: %s'=>'A fi ránṣẹ́ láti: %s','Please add a file.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ fi fáìlì kún un.','Please choose at least one.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ yan ó kéré tán ẹyọ kan.','Please agree to continue.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ gbà láti tẹ̀síwájú.','This field is required.'=>'A gbọdọ fi nkan si àyè yìí.','Please use at most %d characters.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ lo ó pọ̀ jù %d àwọn lẹ́tà.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì tótọ́ síbẹ̀.','Please enter a valid web address.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ àdírẹ́sì wẹ́ẹ̀bù tó wúlò sí i.','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ nọ́ńbà tẹlifóònù tó wúlò.','Please enter a number.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ nọ́ńbà kan sí i.','Please enter a number in the allowed range.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ nọ́ńbà kan sí i láàárín ààyè tí a gbà láàyè.','Please enter a valid date.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ ọjọ́ tó tọ̀nà sí i.','Please choose one of the options.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àṣàyàn náà.','The file could not be uploaded. Please try again.'=>'Kò lè gba fáìlì náà wọlé. Jọ̀wọ́ tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The file is too large (at most %d MB).'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù (ó pọ̀ jù %d MB).','This type of file is not accepted here.'=>'A kò gba irúfẹ́ fáìlì yìí níbí.','This form is no longer available.'=>'Fọọmu yii kò sí mọ́.','This form was open for a long time. Please send it again.'=>'Fọọmu yii ti wa ni ṣiṣi fun igba pipẹ. Jọwọ fi ranṣẹ lẹẹkansi.','Too many submissions. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Àwọn ìfilọ́lẹ̀ ti pọ̀ jù. Ẹ jọ̀wọ́ ẹ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Please check the highlighted fields.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ yẹ àwọn pápá tí a tẹnumọ́ wò.','Thank you. Your message has been sent.'=>'A dupẹ. A ti fi ifiranṣẹ rẹ ranṣẹ.','Send'=>'Firanṣẹ','Leave this field empty'=>'Fi ààyè yìí sílẹ̀ ní òfo','Back'=>'Pada sẹ́yìn','Please choose an option.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ yan àṣàyàn kan.','The form could not be sent. Please check your connection and try again.'=>'Fọọmu naa ko le firanṣẹ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo asopọ rẹ ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Sending…'=>'Ń fi ránṣẹ́…','Choose…'=>'Yan…','You cannot edit that page.'=>'O ò le ṣàtúnṣe ojú-ìwé yẹn.','You cannot publish pages.'=>'O ko le tẹ awọn oju-iwe jade.','The form could not be saved.'=>'Kò le fi fọ́ọ̀mù náà pamọ́.','That form is not on that page.'=>'Fọọmu yẹn kò sí lórí ojú ewé yẹn.','You cannot publish popups.'=>'O kò lè tẹ àwọn agbeleṣọ jade.','The popup could not be saved.'=>'Kò le fi pọp-ọọpu náà pamọ́.','A value of null removes that setting. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Iye ti null máa yọ ètò yẹn kúrò. Àwọn àlejò tí wọ́n béèrè fún ìdínkù ìṣípòpadà kò ní rí ìṣípòpadà náà rárá.','That breakpoint does not exist on this site.'=>'Oju-iduro yẹn ko si lori aaye yii.','These motion settings are unknown or out of range: %s. GET /pbs/v1/marketing/motion lists the choices.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìgbégasókè wọ̀nyí kò mọ̀ tàbí wọ́n kọjá ààlà: %s. GET /pbs/v1/marketing/motion ń ṣe àkójọ àwọn àṣàyàn náà.','No block at that path.'=>'Kò sí bulọ́ọ̀kì kankan ní ipa ọ̀nà yẹn.','Popups'=>'Àwọn agbélẹ̀jọ́','Popup'=>'Ferese agbejade','Add popup'=>'Ṣafikun agbejade','Edit popup'=>'Ṣatunkọ agbejade','No popups yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn agbelewo kankan.','Form submissions'=>'Àwọn ìfúnsílẹ̀ fọ́ọ̀mù','Form submission'=>'Ifisilẹ fọọmu','No submissions yet.'=>'Kò sí àwọn ìfilọ́lẹ̀ kankan tẹ́lẹ̀.','Search submissions'=>'Ṣe àwárí àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́','Submitted values'=>'Àwọn iye tí a fi ránṣẹ́','Sent from %s'=>'A firanṣẹ lati %s','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Mailing list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn olùgbà-ìfiranṣẹ́','sent'=>'Ti firánṣẹ́','failed'=>'Kùnà','Submission'=>'Ìfisílẹ̀','The file is no longer available.'=>'Fáìlì náà kò sí mọ́.','Export CSV'=>'Firanṣẹ CSV sita','There are no live reviews here.'=>'Kò sí àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò tààrà níhìn-ín.','Too many requests. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Àwọn ìbéèrè ti pọ̀ jù. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','That is not a Google place ID. It looks like ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.'=>'Kìí ṣe ID àyè Google. Ó jọ ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.','That is not a Trustpilot business unit ID. It is 24 letters and digits, from your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Iyẹn kì í ṣe Trustpilot business unit ID. O jẹ́ lẹ́tà àti nọ́mbà 24, láti inú àkántì Trustpilot Business yín.','That does not look like an API key: it should be one line of letters, digits and symbols, with no spaces.'=>'Iyẹn kò jọ kókórọ́ API kan: ó yẹ kí ó jẹ́ ìlà kan ti àwọn lẹ́tà, àwọn nọ́mbà àti àwọn àmì, láìsí àwọn àyè.','Google reviews are not set up.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò Google.','The review service could not be reached. The last reviews stay on the site; the next refresh tries again.'=>'Kò lè ráyè sí iṣẹ́ àtúnyẹ̀wò náà. Àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò tó gbẹ̀yìn wà lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà; ìmúdàgbàlékẹ́ tó kàn yóò tún gbìyànjú.','The review service refused the request (HTTP %d). Check the API key and the ID.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àtúnyẹ̀wò kọ̀ ìbéèrè náà (HTTP %d). Ṣàyẹ̀wò kọ́kọ́rọ́ API àti ID náà.','The review service says the API quota is used up. The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àtúnyẹ̀wò sọ pé àyè ìpín API ti tán. Àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò ìgbẹ̀yìn yóò wà lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','The review service answered with an error (HTTP %d). The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àtúnyẹ̀wò náà dáhùn pẹ̀lú àṣìṣe kan (HTTP %d). Àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò ìkẹyìn yóò wà lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Check a page\'s performance'=>'Ṣayẹwo iṣẹ oju-iwe kan','Reports what a page\'s content adds to its weight: its images (bytes, oversized ones and the smaller size that would do), the stylesheets of the blocks it uses and its third-party embeds, each problem with its fix.'=>'Ó ń ròyìn ohun tí àkóónú ojú-ewé kan fi kún ìwọ̀n rẹ̀: àwọn àwòrán rẹ̀ (àwọn byte, àwọn tí wọ́n tóbi jù àti ìwọ̀n tí ó kéré tí yóò tó), àwọn ewé àṣà ti àwọn bulọ́ọ̀kì tí ó ń lò àti àwọn ohun àfikún láti ọwọ́ ẹlẹ́kẹta, ìṣòro kọ̀ọ̀kan pẹ̀lú àtúnṣe rẹ̀.','Read a page\'s structured data'=>'Ka àkójọpọ̀ ìwífún tí a ṣètò ti ojú-ìwé kan','Lists the schema.org structured data a page\'s blocks print (FAQ, How-To, Product, Review, Breadcrumb) and which types are left to the site\'s SEO plugin so nothing is printed twice.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ data tí a tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ ti schema.org tí àwọn bulọ́ọ̀kì ojú-ewé ń tẹ̀ jáde (FAQ, How-To, Product, Review, Breadcrumb) àti àwọn irúfẹ́ tí a fi sílẹ̀ fún àfikún SEO ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà kí a má baà tẹ ohunkóhun jáde lẹ́ẹ̀mejì.','Run the site health report'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́ ìròyìn ìlera ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Finds old revisions, synced patterns nothing uses, heavy original images and design classes no page uses. Works in short steps: each run continues where the last one stopped while the status is "scanning"; restart starts over.'=>'Ó ń wá àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò àtijọ́, àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a fipamọ́ tí kò sí ohun tí ń lò wọ́n, àwọn àwòrán àkọ́kọ́ tí wọ́n wúwo àti àwọn kíláàsì àwòrán tí kò sí ojú-ìwé kankan tí ń lò wọ́n. Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ ní àwọn ìpele kúkúrú: iṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan ń tẹ̀síwájú láti ibi tí èyí tí ó gbẹ̀yìn dúró sí nígbà tí ipò bá jẹ́ "scanning"; àtúnbẹ̀rẹ̀ ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀pẹ̀.','Clean up what the site health report found'=>'Nu ohun ti iroyin ilera aaye ayelujara naa ri nu','Cleans one kind of finding: revisions (keeps each post\'s newest 5, deletes older ones), patterns (moves unused synced patterns to the trash), images (a scaled copy WordPress uses; the original is kept), classes (removes unused design classes, kept for restoring). Each run cleans one batch; "more" is true while findings remain.'=>'Ó ń fọ irú àbájáde kan mọ́: àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò (ó ń tọ́jú 5 tuntun jùlọ fún àkọsílẹ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, ó ń pa àwọn tó ti gbó rẹ́), àwọn àpẹẹrẹ (ó ń gbé àwọn àpẹẹrẹ àgbékalẹ̀ tí a kò lò tí a mú dọ́gba lọ sínú àpò ìdàkùnrọ̀), àwọn àwòrán (ẹ̀dà tí a tún ìwọ̀n rẹ̀ ṣe tí WordPress ń lò; a ń tọ́jú èyí àkọ́kọ́), àwọn kíláàsì (ó ń yọ àwọn kíláàsì àwòrán tí a kò lò kúrò, tí a tọ́jú fún ìmúbọ̀sípò). Ìgbésẹ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan ń fọ ìpele kan mọ́; "more" jẹ́ òótọ́ níwọ̀n ìgbà tí àwọn àbájáde ṣì wà.','Unknown clean-up.'=>'Ìfọ̀mọ́ àìmọ̀.','Run the site health report first; a clean-up only removes what the report found.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ ṣiṣẹ́ ìròyìn ìlera ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà; ìmúlọ́wọ́gùn kìkì ohun tí ìròyìn náà rí ni yóò mú kúrò.','You may not edit this image.'=>'O ko le ṣatunkọ aworan yi.','This image cannot be scaled.'=>'A ko le ran aworan yii siwaju tabi seyin.','A scaled copy would not be smaller.'=>'Ẹ̀dà tí a tún ìwọ̀n rẹ̀ ṣe kì yóò kéré sí i.','That template type does not exist on this site.'=>'Irú àdàkọ yẹn kò sí lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','The template could not be saved.'=>'A kò le fi àdàkọ náà pamọ́.','The template could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Kò le gbé àdàkọ náà lọ sí inú àpótí ìdàkọ̀.','That post d