%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Ọ̀nà ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ àtúnyẹ̀wò yìí kò wúlò mọ́. Béèrè fún tuntun kan.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àfikún ti pọ̀ jù láti orí ọ̀nà asopọ̀ yìí ní wákàtí tí ó kọjá. Ẹ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi nígbà míràn.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Ipa rẹ ko le ṣẹda awọn apẹrẹ tabi awọn ilana.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'O le yí ọ̀rọ̀ àti àwọn àwòrán tí ó wà lórí ojú-ewé yìí padà, sùgbọ́n kì í ṣe àtòjọ tàbí àwòrán rẹ̀. Àyípadà rẹ kò wọlé.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Ipa rẹ ko le yi awọn àkànṣe-ìrísí pada. Yi awọn iyipada àkànṣe-ìrísí pada ki o tun fipamọ lẹẹkansi.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Ipa rẹ ko le ṣafikun tabi yi koodu aṣa pada (CSS aṣa tabi awọn bulọọki HTML). Yi awọn iyipada wọnyẹn pada ki o tun fipamọ lẹẹkansi.','There is no such post.'=>'Kò sí irú àtẹ̀jáde bẹ́ẹ̀.','The page is too large to analyse.'=>'Ojú-ìwé náà tóbi jù láti ṣàyèwò.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Èyí kì í ṣe fáìlì àgbéjáde láti inú àfikún yìí.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Ẹ̀yà tuntun ti àfikún náà ló ṣe fáìlì ìkójáde yìí. Ṣe àgbéga sí àfikún náà lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, lẹ́yìn náà kí ẹ tún kó o wọlé.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Fáìlì ìkójáde náà ti bàjẹ́: àkójọ àwọn nǹkan inú rẹ̀ kò sí.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Fáìlì ìkójáde náà ti bàjẹ́ tàbí a ti ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀ lẹ́yìn tí a ṣe é (àkópọ̀ ìṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kò bá a mu). Tún kójáde láti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù kejì.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'