st is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'A rán ìbéèrè rẹ láti orí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí sí %s, ẹni tí ó ṣe àfikún yìí. À ń rán:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail àti orúkọ yín, kí a lè fèsì;','the subject and message you write;'=>'kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ àti ìránṣẹ́ tí ẹ kọ;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID iwe-aṣẹ rẹ, ki awọn alabara ti n sanwo le gba pataki;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kiki ti o ba samisi rẹ: awọn alaye aaye ayelujara (awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP, akori, awọn ohun-itanna, apakan ti akọọlẹ aṣiṣe pẹlu awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ati awọn adirẹsi imeeli ti a yọ kuro), eyiti o le ka ṣaaju fifiranṣẹ;','I agree, continue'=>'Mo gbà, tẹ̀síwájú','The connection could not be checked.'=>'A kò le yẹ ìsopọ̀ wò.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Kò ṣiṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn Digital® ti ge asopọ aaye ayelujara yii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn Digital® kò mọ aaye ayelujara yii mọ.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Ẹ ti ge asopọ aaye yii.','Connect this site to support'=>'So aaye ayelujara yii pọ mọ atilẹyin','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ti sopọ. Awọn idahun yoo lọ si %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'A ko sopọ. O si le fi ibeere ranṣẹ pẹlu adirẹsi imeeli rẹ ni isalẹ; sisopọ yoo gba ọ laaye lati má kọ ọ ni gbogbo igba.','E-mail address'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail','Your name (optional)'=>'Orukọ rẹ (aṣayan)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Mo gba lati sopọ aaye yii mọ iranlọ